sequenceDiagram
  participant SRC as Claims/enrollment/document sources
  participant ING as Go/Python normalizers
  participant K as Kafka
  participant F as Flink stateful streams
  participant DL as Delta Lake bronze/silver/gold
  participant ER as Entity resolver + temporal graph
  participant FE as Feast/Redis features
  participant AI as Ray GNN + NLP/LLM gateways
  participant DEC as Go rule-first decision service
  participant CASE as Temporal case workflow
  participant REV as Coder/investigator reviewer

  SRC->>ING: X12/FHIR/document/list/contact event
  ING->>K: Canonical event with tenant, purpose, lineage, hash
  K->>F: Keyed event-time stream
  F->>F: Dedup, watermark, CEP, windows, filing/deadline checks
  F->>DL: Append normalized silver facts and feature deltas
  F->>ER: Entity/relationship delta
  ER->>ER: Exact identifiers, probabilistic match, abstain if uncertain
  ER->>DL: Versioned graph edge and evidence
  ER->>FE: Materialize approved point-in-time features
  DL->>AI: Frozen snapshots for Ray training/backtest
  FE->>AI: Bounded GNN/NLP assessment request
  AI-->>DEC: Calibrated advisory + evidence refs or abstain
  DEC->>DEC: Hard rules, quality gates, score fusion, reason codes
  DEC->>CASE: DecisionRecord + CaseTask
  CASE->>REV: Source spans, graph subgraph, citations, uncertainty
  REV-->>CASE: Accept, modify, reject, or request more evidence
  CASE->>DL: Disposition and outcome label candidate
  CASE->>DEC: Authorized disposition — no direct model action
